WEBVTT

00:00:00.308 --> 00:00:01.794
A thousand things on your mind?

00:00:01.991 --> 00:00:03.338
Put the next one right here.

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:04.430
Meet Stickly.

00:00:04.662 --> 00:00:07.251
Beautiful handwritten notes for your Windows desktop.

00:00:07.611 --> 00:00:08.783
Capture ideas.

00:00:09.085 --> 00:00:10.281
Check off tasks.

00:00:10.583 --> 00:00:11.407
Pick a colour.

00:00:11.883 --> 00:00:12.975
Pin what matters.

00:00:13.392 --> 00:00:14.542
Then grab a corner.

00:00:15.018 --> 00:00:18.153
Peel it away, follow your cursor, and click

00:00:18.222 --> 00:00:19.557
to stick it somewhere new.

00:00:20.126 --> 00:00:20.904
Resize it.

00:00:21.206 --> 00:00:22.472
Restore old notes.

00:00:22.948 --> 00:00:24.085
Bring it back with Alt N.

00:00:24.654 --> 00:00:25.293
No account.

00:00:25.397 --> 00:00:26.013
No cloud.

00:00:26.314 --> 00:00:27.859
Just a little more headspace.

00:00:28.335 --> 00:00:28.973
Stickly.
